 "content": "\n<div id=\"ondo-hub\" class=\"o-hub-intro\"><div><span class=\"o-px\">ETF</span><p>ETF의 수익률·배당·보수를 같은 기간, 같은 기준으로 계산해 비교합니다. 투자 권유가 아니라, 숫자를 스스로 읽는 데 필요한 것만 정리합니다.</p></div><div class=\"o-scale\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:120px\"></div></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-query o-list is-layout-flow wp-block-query-is-layout-flow\"><ul class=\"wp-block-post-template is-layout-flow wp-block-post-template-is-layout-flow\"><li class=\"wp-block-post post-771 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-etf tag-dgro tag-etf tag-1584 tag-schd tag-vym\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/22/why-dividend-growth-rate-matters/\" target=\"_self\" ><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_10809877.png?resize=1200%2C675&#038;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"배당 ETF 고를 때 배당률보다 배당성장률을 먼저 봐야 하는 이유\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_10809877.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_10809877.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_10809877.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_10809877.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" data-attachment-id=\"803\" data-permalink=\"https://ondo99.com/cover_art_10809877/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_10809877.png?fit=1200%2C675&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,675\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"cover_art_10809877\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_10809877.png?fit=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1\" /></a></figure>\n<div class=\"taxonomy-category wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/category/etf/\" rel=\"tag\">ETF·투자</a></div>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-post-title\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/22/why-dividend-growth-rate-matters/\" target=\"_self\" >배당 ETF 고를 때 배당률보다 배당성장률을 먼저 봐야 하는 이유</a></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt\"><p class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt\">SCHD는 세 ETF 중 지금 가격 기준 배당률이 가장 높지만, 이 숫자만으로는 앞으로 받게 될 배당금이 어떻게 변할지 알기 어렵습니다.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-22T11:52:31+09:00\">11월 22, 2026</time></div>\n</li><li class=\"wp-block-post post-768 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-etf tag-aapl tag-etf tag-1882 tag-1876 tag-1878 tag-1530\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/21/apple-company-overview-revenue-mdd-dividend-etf/\" target=\"_self\" ><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_91489847.png?resize=1200%2C675&#038;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"애플은 어떤 회사인가: 매출·낙폭·배당, 그리고 ETF 비중\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_91489847.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_91489847.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_91489847.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_91489847.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" data-attachment-id=\"801\" data-permalink=\"https://ondo99.com/cover_art_91489847/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_91489847.png?fit=1200%2C675&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,675\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"cover_art_91489847\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_91489847.png?fit=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1\" /></a></figure>\n<div class=\"taxonomy-category wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/category/etf/\" rel=\"tag\">ETF·투자</a></div>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-post-title\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/21/apple-company-overview-revenue-mdd-dividend-etf/\" target=\"_self\" >애플은 어떤 회사인가: 매출·낙폭·배당, 그리고 ETF 비중</a></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt\"><p class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt\">애플은 2026년 기준 매출 4,788억 달러, 영업이익률 33.0%를 기록한 미국 상장 기업입니다. 주가 흐름을 보면 지난 10년 동안 발생한 최대 낙폭(MDD, 가장 높았던 값에서 가장 낮았던 값까지 떨어진 비율)은 -38.5%였으며, 현재 가격 기준 배당수익률은…</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-21T18:25:19+09:00\">11월 21, 2026</time></div>\n</li><li class=\"wp-block-post post-762 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-etf tag-etf tag-1572 tag-1570 tag-qqq tag-spy\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/21/lump-sum-vs-dca-actual-price-comparison/\" target=\"_self\" ><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_45028643.png?resize=1200%2C675&#038;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"2021~2026년 실제 가격으로 본 적립식 vs 거치식 투자 비교\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_45028643.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_45028643.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_45028643.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_45028643.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" data-attachment-id=\"791\" data-permalink=\"https://ondo99.com/cover_art_45028643/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_45028643.png?fit=1200%2C675&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,675\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"cover_art_45028643\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_45028643.png?fit=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1\" /></a></figure>\n<div class=\"taxonomy-category wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/category/etf/\" rel=\"tag\">ETF·투자</a></div>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-post-title\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/21/lump-sum-vs-dca-actual-price-comparison/\" target=\"_self\" >2021~2026년 실제 가격으로 본 적립식 vs 거치식 투자 비교</a></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt\"><p class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt\">2021년 12월부터 2026년 11월까지 59개월 동안 미국 증시 대표 지수를 추종하는 ETF인 SPY와 QQQ에 투자했을 때, 거치식 투자가 적립식 투자보다 더 높은 수익률을 기록했습니다.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-21T12:16:31+09:00\">11월 21, 2026</time></div>\n</li><li class=\"wp-block-post post-756 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-etf tag-etf tag-1530 tag-mdd tag-qqq tag-schd\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/20/mdd-etf-guide/\" target=\"_self\" ><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_38540924.png?resize=1200%2C675&#038;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"최대 낙폭(MDD)으로 내가 버틸 수 있는 ETF 고르기\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_38540924.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_38540924.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_38540924.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_38540924.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" data-attachment-id=\"789\" data-permalink=\"https://ondo99.com/cover_art_38540924/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_38540924.png?fit=1200%2C675&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,675\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"cover_art_38540924\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_38540924.png?fit=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1\" /></a></figure>\n<div class=\"taxonomy-category wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/category/etf/\" rel=\"tag\">ETF·투자</a></div>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-post-title\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/20/mdd-etf-guide/\" target=\"_self\" >최대 낙폭(MDD)으로 내가 버틸 수 있는 ETF 고르기</a></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt\"><p class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt\">최근 5년간 미국 시장 대표 ETF들의 최대 낙폭(MDD, 가장 높았던 값에서 가장 낮았던 값까지 떨어진 비율)을 집계해 보면 TLT -50.0%, QQQ -35.5%, SCHD -18.9%로 종목마다 자산이 줄어드는 폭에서 큰 차이를 보였습니다.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-20T20:02:38+09:00\">11월 20, 2026</time></div>\n</li><li class=\"wp-block-post post-705 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-etf tag-etf tag-1870 tag-1868 tag-1610 tag-spy\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/19/etf-total-expense-ratio-difference-10-years/\" target=\"_self\" ><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_14750226.png?resize=1200%2C675&#038;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"ETF 총보수 0.1% 차이, 10년 뒤 내 계좌엔 얼마 차이날까?\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_14750226.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_14750226.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_14750226.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_14750226.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" data-attachment-id=\"787\" data-permalink=\"https://ondo99.com/cover_art_14750226/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_14750226.png?fit=1200%2C675&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,675\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"cover_art_14750226\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_14750226.png?fit=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1\" /></a></figure>\n<div class=\"taxonomy-category wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/category/etf/\" rel=\"tag\">ETF·투자</a></div>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-post-title\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/19/etf-total-expense-ratio-difference-10-years/\" target=\"_self\" >ETF 총보수 0.1% 차이, 10년 뒤 내 계좌엔 얼마 차이날까?</a></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt\"><p class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt\">원금 1,000만 원을 보수 떼기 전 연 5% 수익률 조건으로 투자할 때, 총보수만 0.1%p(퍼센트포인트: 비율끼리 뺀 차이) 차이 나는 두 ETF의 10년 뒤 격차는 약 16만 원입니다.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-19T23:01:05+09:00\">11월 19, 2026</time></div>\n</li><li class=\"wp-block-post post-701 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-etf tag-etf tag-isa tag-1428 tag-1394\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/19/overseas-vs-domestic-etf-tax/\" target=\"_self\" ><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_85222549.png?resize=1200%2C675&#038;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"해외 상장 ETF vs 국내 상장 ETF, 한 해 이익 833만 원이 가르는 세금 차이\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_85222549.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_85222549.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_85222549.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_85222549.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" data-attachment-id=\"785\" data-permalink=\"https://ondo99.com/cover_art_85222549/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_85222549.png?fit=1200%2C675&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,675\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"cover_art_85222549\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/ondo99.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover_art_85222549.png?fit=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1\" /></a></figure>\n<div class=\"taxonomy-category wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/category/etf/\" rel=\"tag\">ETF·투자</a></div>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-post-title\"><a href=\"https://ondo99.com/2026/11/19/overseas-vs-domestic-etf-tax/\" target=\"_self\" >해외 상장 ETF vs 국내 상장 ETF, 한 해 이익 833만 원이 가르는 세금 차이</a></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt\"><p class=\"wp-block-post-excerpt__excerpt\">일반계좌에서 동일한 해외 지수를 추종하는 상품에 투자할 때, 한 해 이익이 약 833만 원이면 해외 상장 ETF와 국내 상장 해외지수 ETF의 세금이 같습니다.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-post-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-19T17:23:22+09:00\">11월 19, 2026</time></div>\n</li></ul>\n</div>\n",
